      "comment": "SHINY PISTOL (1) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 4th (17.49) at this track. Has winning claims on his best figures. MINH JACK (2) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close third, 2 lengths from the winner Dashing Darley (23.27) at Gawler. Can feature again. KING TOBY (6) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on his slick win the start prior, getting around this track over 300m in 16.71. Smart winner two back and looks a key chance on that form. MAFIA MISTRESS (8) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
